{pad:meta title='Positions into terms', about='A type that computes terms turns each number n into its nth term.'/}
<p>prime:  {make:range '1..8', prime}{$sequence} {/make:range}</p>
<p>square: {make:range '1..8', square}{$sequence} {/make:range}</p>
<p>The default mode, with only a type: {make:fibonacci rows=8}{$sequence} {/make:fibonacci}</p>
